    "note": "In the research scenario, the coordinator splits the housing question into four separate scopes. When the results come back, it notices that rural areas are not covered at all, so it sends one more search before synthesis. Later, a user asks a quick factual follow-up. The coordinator sends that to a single search agent instead of rerunning the whole pipeline."
