    "note": "Picture the support scenario. Two tools both say gets customer data, and the agent flips between them. Do not reach for a routing layer yet. First decide what each tool really does, then rewrite the descriptions so each one says what it covers and where the other tool takes over. Then replay real conversations and measure whether selection improved."
