    "note": "The exam loves the tempting fix that adds machinery. If tools are misrouted, the right first move is almost always to improve the descriptions and names. Extra classifiers, louder system prompt rules and catch-all tools all treat the symptom. A clear, bounded description treats the cause, and it costs almost nothing."
