    "note": "Distractors to watch for. Assuming subagents share the coordinator's memory, when you must pass context explicitly. Handing every agent every tool. Blending conflicting figures into one number instead of showing both with their sources and dates. And running independent subagents one by one rather than in parallel from a single response."
