    "note": "For scenario three, remember that missing coverage usually traces back to how the coordinator split the work. Subagents inherit nothing, so pass what they need. Errors should travel with their type, what was tried and partial results. And the synthesis must keep every claim tied to its source, showing disagreements rather than hiding them."
